Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1017-1018] Onigashima 31 - Jinbe vs Who_s Who.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,J-o-i-n?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,J-o-i-n?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's all take out Kaido, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Order acknowledged!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hamlet-sama's totally lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:52.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1709,241)}Castle Interior, Fourth Floor\NBig Cat Café
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got you, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First Son of the Sea, Jinbe!\NLeave the peanut gallery to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat the living crap\Noutta Who's Who!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poker!\NYou filthy piece of...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your backup has arrived, samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.63,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1688,258)}Castle Interior\NSecond Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're behind Straw Hat\Nall the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Castle interior, second floor, checking in.\NGifters have switched sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did it, O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were amazing, Tama!\NYour words reached everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was totally worth it, o-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, O-Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:07.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mission definitely accomplished!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! The table's so turned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...\NThat runt's behind this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat it and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The end!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Collier Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damned...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:19.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son of Judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not say that name\Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were you part of that team\Nof mad scientists too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,MADS, ya mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, that was forever ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check out my bod!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'mma lay it all out for ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noticed that a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Queen's Man-Beast Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You noticin' don't matter\Nif ya can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper...\NMossbrain's gonna make it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yessirree...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be just fine 'n dandy, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, uh...\Nare you gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...\NThanks for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be a-okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a mere side effect\Nof the Rumble Ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:54.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1387,737)}Baby Geezer Chopper\N(Side Effect of the Rumble Ball)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We of the Mink Tribe have...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:06:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean to say, there exists a medicine,\Npassed down within our tribe in Zou,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A medicine so potent that it heals even\Nthe most grievous wounds in no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the side effects later will cause him\Nto suffer twice as much as he is now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under my discretion,\NI can't administer it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give me the jab already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were listening in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't got time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There ain't no point in worryin' about\Nwhat happens to my body later...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I can't fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Defections from the Headliners\Nand Gifters to the samurai army...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,number approximately 300!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:52.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The order from the girl that took\Nthe stage on the Performance Floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...most likely affected them\Nin some way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a move on, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn her and her weird tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we kill her, is that gonna bring the bunch of guys\Nshe's got under her thumb back to their senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap! They're after Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gunning for a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And those scumbuckets\Ncall themselves pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna protect O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got some asses to kick!\NGo on without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here come the Headliners!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scorpion...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all sunk!\NThe bunch of yous are already poisoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gaaaahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daifugo-kun, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The operation was a huge success,\NMaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, climb aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horselina-chan,\Nthank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:19.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me hop on too,\Nif it's not any trouble! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just saw Komachiyo\Nover there, collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's about time I got serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blade Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arabesque Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:52.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Shaving!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tempest Kick!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should I perhaps call this\N"Iron Body," then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are techniques from the\Nfighting style in use by Government agents...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:25.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Six Forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:30.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\NI heard a rumor a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that a member of CP, the Government's\Nsecret intelligence agency, escaped from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:37.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strange story, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About an intelligence agent\Nbeing imprisoned, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:44.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And how is it that you remember\Na scandal like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That escaped agent...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we acquainted, by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, but once upon a time,\NI did see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,back when I was in CP9,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you were still a Warlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, we're both in\Ntotally different situations from then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like who I am now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I went through a hell of a lot\Nto get to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All thanks to one single screw-up\Nthirteen years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:45.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They used to say I was as promising as\Nthe brilliant Rob Lucci
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What that story has to do with me,\NI haven't the foggiest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NEars open, mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fang Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now there's a Form\NI haven't seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:12.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I pity you, but I'm afraid I\Nhave nothing to do with you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not exactly true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:18.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that you're a proud crew member\Nof the Straw Hats, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That name brings back\Nbitter memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thirteen years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit in transit\Naboard a Government ship was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And two years ago, when Straw Hat Luffy\Nrose to prominence,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was shocked to learn...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that Straw Hat had eaten\Nthe very Gum-Gum Fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:46.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that was stolen from me\Nback then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer right, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giddy up, Horselina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger-dodger, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave Komachiyo to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya mean it?!\NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:37.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daifugo-kun, Gazelleman-kun...\Nplease be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer both...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer both...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,precious friends to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-r-i e-n-d-So...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fr-i-e-n-d-s...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awwright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for us, Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat my counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your ability's\Nreally something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Normally you don't make\Nfriends on the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Nami...\NSpeaking of "friends..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you make me\Nyour servant again, like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!\NNot a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- How's partner sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There they are!\NIt's the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a step closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami's partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And she's totally got him\Nwrapped around her finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down with Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pave the way to victory for\NMaster and the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Approximately 2,000\Nhave defected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:18.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1495,402)}Castle Interior\NGuest Parlor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the number of troops blindsided\Nand taken down by them: 2,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meaning, the Animal Kingdom Pirates\Nstarted with 30,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dwindled to 20,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:28.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lost 2,000 to mutiny,\Nand a further 2,000 to injury,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,shrinking our forces even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the Gifters continue their rampage,\Nthe white pieces on the board will multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which side wins\Nis of no concern to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we must verify his death, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But is it truly him, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.55,0:14:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would seem that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless, the information\Nhe absconded with is out of date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It poses no threat\Nto the Government,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I disagree...\NWe can't allow precedent to be set...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That one can flee\Nour organization and yet live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that is if he survives...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fights against...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the mighty Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean to say...\NYou bear a grudge against Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:38.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be precise, my grudge is with\Nthe Gum-Gum Fruit's thief...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Red Haired" Shanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that thieving scum's fault\Nmy life's all screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fang Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both the straw hat\Nhe wore at the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and the Gum-Gum Fruit\Nwere inherited by the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So naturally,\NI turned my grudge toward him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blocking's impossible\Neven with your Color of Arms, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good choice...\NYour typical Color of Arms won't save you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though, I'm surprised how quickly\Nyou can move on land, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know...\Nfor a Fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do know casual racism against Fishmen\Nis out of style, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be mad, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:01.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\NI wanna ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fang Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Jujutsu:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Low Tide...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Shoulder Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oof...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,God damn,\Nyou're merciless...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, why don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...listen to what I got to say,\Njust for a few seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While I was behind bars,\NI heard this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While I was busy\Nbeing tortured,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they mocked me,\Ntold me to pray for salvation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to the Sun God, Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is an ancient, legendary warrior,\None that slaves believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...would one day set them free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he exist,\Nor was he just someone's fever dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A warrior that made people laugh,\Nall the while delivering them from suffering...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My time in prison\Nfelt so endless...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:57.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I actually clung to that\Nbizarre legend of theirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Save me!" I thought to myself.\N"Someone, anyone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard your old crew,\Nthe Sun Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...counted among their ranks\Nformer slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman history\Nis all about slavery, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guard who told me about Nika...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...was executed shortly after!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I risked it all to break out,\Nand here I am today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it bad for one's health\Njust to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fascinating, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:53.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shark Crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've nothing to say\Nto the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...\NDid I flip a switch or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here comes the puncture wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fang Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell is up with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate, Secret Art:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch the tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demon Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demon Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demon Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're going to\Nrun your mouth about history...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you had best be ready for\Nwhat you're stepping into first!
